==Strategy==
Stack long-ranged attackers such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to counter both Crazed Moneko and the Gory Darks, while using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to take out St. Pigge the 2nd. Don't spawn any meatshields once most of the stronger peons are down, unless you want to trigger Crazed Moneko's [[Wave Attack]].

